This directory intentionally keeps only the minimum PlatformIO Unity runner.

Current contents:
- `test_runner.cpp` - placeholder Unity entrypoint for the `seeed_xiao_esp32s3_test` environment

Add new tests here only when there is an active test plan to maintain them.

PlatformIO unit testing docs:
- https://docs.platformio.org/en/latest/advanced/unit-testing/index.html
